  "content": "<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img\n    width=\"50%\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db40482722d3dd46277aa9aee8e2dc86bcb3f704_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"Enchanted Fishing Line\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/134d4bb74f136d7122457c5643653409764c896a.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img width=\"40%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6559c78833608f3dcef211a6ab680bc09de7df0a.png\" alt=\"features\"/></a>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n  <img alt=\"punchy\" width=\"30%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d5640b938aec7675e8196b98a6cbc419c757417b.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img\n    width=\"10%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aa2a5a30c130eee2a12a1930c5498c6af3905436.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n\n<br>\n\n<div>\n   <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanted-fishing-line\">\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1905c438a7c4965489077cac7feaca06385cad12.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  /></a>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<section>\n  <p>\n    <b>附魔釣魚竿</b> 完全重做了 Minecraft 的原始釣魚竿。它用一根高度逼真、具有物理模擬的 3D 釣線取代了僵硬繩索。釣線在重力下會下垂，動態彎曲，完美碰撞方塊，不會穿模。<br>\n    <b>100% 客戶端運行</b>\n  </p>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n  <img\n    width=\"100%\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bceb25df5ca5f8aa9553252af9df39c163b8494e.png\"\n    alt=\"divider\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n<b>互動式釣魚小遊戲：</b> 當魚上鉤時會出現高度響應的 HUD。平衡釣線張力並填充進度條以釣起魚。若張力進入紅色區域，釣線就會斷裂！\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n<b>物理魚類渲染：</b> 再也不要見魚 magically 出現在你的背包里。Better Fishing 會在你收線時，於釣鉤上渲染出實體或物品圖形。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n<b>程序化收線動畫：</b> 與 Punchy 搭配時，此 mod 提供數學驅動的程式化手臂和釣竿動畫。當你和魚對抗時，釣竿會彎曲且你的手臂會向後傾斜。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <h3>授權說明</h3>\n  ARR（保留所有權利）<br>\n  你允許將此 mod 加入 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 的模组包，無需申請許可。<br>\n  不得重新分發 jar 文件。\n</div>",
